---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="FAQ">
  <div class="container page-hero"><div class="eyebrow" data-zh="常见问题">FAQ</div><h1 data-zh="你可能想知道。">Good to know.</h1></div>
  <section class="container legal" style="padding-top:0"><div class="faq-item"><h3 data-zh="试用从什么时候开始？">When does the trial begin?</h3><p data-zh="邮箱验证成功并创建账户时开始，连续 7 × 24 小时；重新登录或重装插件不会重置。">When you verify your email and create an account. It lasts 7 × 24 hours; signing in again or reinstalling the extension does not reset it.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3 data-zh="30 次额度什么时候重置？">When does the daily limit reset?</h3><p data-zh="北京时间每天 00:00。每次生成同时给三种风格，只计一次。">At midnight in Asia/Shanghai. A generation gives three styles and counts once.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3 data-zh="会自动发送 X 回复吗？">Does it automatically post on X?</h3><p data-zh="不会。插件只提供草稿，发送由你决定。">No. It prepares drafts; you decide what to send.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3 data-zh="已经配置的个人 DeepSeek Key 会怎样？">What happens to my personal DeepSeek key?</h3><p data-zh="本地开发模式保留原有 BYOK 使用方式。未来终身版使用你自己的 Key；免费体验使用托管 AI。">The local development mode keeps BYOK. The planned lifetime license uses your key; the trial uses hosted AI.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3 data-zh="现在可以购买吗？">Can I purchase now?</h3><p data-zh="不能。终身版价格为计划，支付和退款流程尚未正式开放。">No. Lifetime pricing is planned. Checkout and refunds are not live.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3 data-zh="在哪里反馈问题？">How can I send feedback?</h3><p><a href="/feedback" style="color:#176fce" data-zh="使用反馈表单。">Use the feedback form.</a></p></div></section>
</Base>
